Subject: Cantor Self Work Update Broker B1 CDrive Production Preparation Plan P0 Justification

@ [justification_uuid] 8287b9d2-681e-4432-a4b8-57d4770c2f19
@ [canonical_uuid] 209c5c94-fd65-4f93-946b-bec56912b29e

& [Need]
  + B1 can validate and contain a later run but lacks a canonical operator-inspectable carrier for its physical preparation
  + SWA-06B fixture persistence does not supply a read-scoped live host or authentic B1 preparation
  + adequate observed capacity makes preparation design timely while remaining insufficient authority to perform it

& [Choice]
  + implement pure supplied-data plan compilation and independent evidence before any external preparation producer
  + reuse existing Cantor digest strict JSON and evidence patterns without dependency growth

& [Rejected]
  + directly create C-drive scratch worktree ref lease ledger or evidence state from a general work-slice instruction
  + generate or self-sign an operator commission
  + rerun SWA-06B fixture persistence as if it were B1 host readiness
  + contact provider remote WSL Minecraft FPGA or arbitrary D-drive paths

& [Proportionality]
  + the new Rust surface is bounded pure and independently verifiable
  + it removes ambiguity from the next physical review without increasing runtime authority
